  "body": "### Summary\nLOT-102 (#470) adds image upload to the composer, but no build gives the app a rehost API key yet, so uploading stays off. The key has to reach the build the way ADR 0007 says: a git-ignored `.xcconfig` for local builds, a GitHub Actions secret for CI and release, read through `Info.plist`, and never committed.\n\n### Scope\n- Add the git-ignored `.xcconfig` entry and the `Info.plist` key that the LOT-102 code reads. Check #470 for the exact name.\n- Add the CI and release secret, which the maintainer sets.\n- On the Mac, check that an upload works, and that a build with no key hides the upload button instead of failing.\n\n### Sources\n- ADR 0007 (third-party API keys)\n- #470 child report on #368, item \"Left\"\n\nNot claimed: it needs the maintainer's Mac and secrets.",
